{
  "Name": "Windows 10 UAC Protection Bypass Via Windows Store (WSReset.exe) and Registry",
  "Description": "This module exploits a flaw in the WSReset.exe file associated with the Windows Store. This binary has autoelevate privs, and it will run a binary file contained in a low-privilege registry location. By placing a link to the binary in the registry location, WSReset.exe will launch the binary as a privileged user.",
